# React UI

## Components

- Use shadcn/ui primitives from `@/components/ui/*` (new-york style)
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Feature components live in `src/components/{admin,mobile,location,coach,...}/`
- Marketing blocks: PascalCase files in `src/components/` (e.g. `Hero.tsx`, `Navbar.tsx`)

## Client vs Server

- Add `'use client'` only when using hooks, browser APIs, or event handlers
- Admin/coach layouts guard auth client-side via `useSession()` + role redirect
- Prefer server components for static/marketing pages when possible

## Visual Design

Follow `ui-design` rule for colors, typography, radius, marketing vs admin patterns. Use semantic tokens in admin; brand hex in public marketing pages.

- Icons: Lucide (`lucide-react`)
- Toasts: `sonner` via root layout `Toaster`

## Mobile (Capacitor)

- Detect platform with `usePlatform()` from `@/hooks/usePlatform`
- Mobile-specific UI in `src/components/mobile/` and `MobileHomePage`
- Do not assume static export — iOS dev uses live reload to `localhost:3000`

## Naming

- React components: PascalCase files and exports
- Route segments: kebab-case (`course-catalog`, `learning-paths`)
